Iranian state television: Foreign Minister Araghchi met U.S. envoy Steve Witkoff on the sidelines of the UN General Assembly, a meeting Washington asked for. Tehran agreed in order to pass along its conditions for reopening the Strait of Hormuz.
@Osint613

The conditions: immediate lifting of the naval blockade, immediate release of all frozen Iranian funds, and an end to the war on all resistance fronts.
